claim.claim-text:
a substrate (210);
a plurality of light sources (220) disposed on an upper surface of the substrate;
a resin layer (230) disposed on an upper surface of the substrate; and
a phosphor layer (240) disposed on the resin layer;
wherein the resin layer (230) includes a first resin portion (231) having the same height from the substrate and a second resin portion (233) having a height variable from the substrate,
wherein the plurality of light sources (220) is disposed in the first resin portion (231) and the second resin portion (233) of the resin layer (230).,
